  DialogueSnippets:
  - SpeakerName: Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 080caa0edd7536d448df7e9c059c8f9a, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: 'My parents didnt care that I lost the annual swimming competetion, but
      I lost that swimming  scholarship for my school. I could have saved them money.
      Why didn''t they care '
  - SpeakerName: Young Mina
    HasSpeakerSprite: 1
    SpeakerSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 19cb878ae217df648ba82e0116391c43, type: 3}
    HasBackgroundSprite: 0
    BackgroundSprite: {fileID: 0}
    Text: Wow, so you want your parents to burden a child with THEIR responsibilities,
      and I am the young one ??
